<section xml:id="sec-5-2" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
  <title>Systems of ODEs: An Introduction</title>

  <introduction>
    <p>
        Sometimes we want to model a situation with multiple functions (such as multiple populations) that interact
         with each other. This leads to systems of ODEs. 
     </p>
  </introduction>

